  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "common_0210_rival_01",
      "hash64": "38E36967BE56EA7D",
      "text": "Oye, [VAR 0x0100(0000)]! Over here![VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 5,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "common_0210_rival_02",
      "hash64": "38E36667BE56E564",
      "text": "This here’s a Pokémon Center![VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 29,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "common_0210_rival_03",
      "hash64": "38E36767BE56E717",
      "text": "You can come here to take care of a lot of things\\nrelated to your Pokémon.[VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 74,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "common_0210_rival_04",
      "hash64": "38E36467BE56E1FE",
      "text": "But I’ll leave the explanations to the pros here.[VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 49,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "common_0210_pokecen_01",
      "hash64": "AD11B217AFBB942A",
      "text": "Happy to be of service—and welcome to the\\nPokémon Center!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "common_0210_pokecen_02",
      "hash64": "AD11B117AFBB9277",
      "text": "I’m here to keep everyone’s Pokémon healthy.",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "common_0210_pokecen_03",
      "hash64": "AD11B017AFBB90C4",
      "text": "And this to my right is the Technical Machine\\nMachine—TM Machine for short!",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "common_0210_pokecen_04",
      "hash64": "AD11AF17AFBB8F11",
      "text": "It’s your ticket to making TMs, which you can use\\nto teach moves to your Pokémon.",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "common_0210_pokecen_05",
      "hash64": "AD11AE17AFBB8D5E",
      "text": "You’ll need to pay in [VAR 0xFF00(0006)]LP[VAR 0xFF00(0000)] and supply the machine\\nwith [VAR 0xFF00(0006)]materials[VAR 0xFF00(0000)] that Pokémon drop.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 28,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 61,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 74,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "common_0210_rival_10",
      "hash64": "38E6CE67BE59CBF3",
      "text": "LP comes in handy both at these machines and at\\nstores! I’ve got a lot—here, have some![VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 87,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "common_0210_rival_11",
      "hash64": "38E6CD67BE59CA40",
      "text": "Oh yeah, and some of these too![VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 31,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "common_0210_system_01",
      "hash64": "F7614DBDC1C939C0",
      "text": "You received lots of Pokémon [VAR 0xFF00(0008)]materials [VAR 0xFF00(0000)]from\\nNemona!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 29,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 43,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "common_0210_pokecen_06",
      "hash64": "AD11AD17AFBB8BAB",
      "text": "Here on my left is the Poké Mart counter! You\\ncan buy things like Poké Balls and Potions.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "common_0210_shop_01",
      "hash64": "7B9566714708511F",
      "text": "Hello! We accept payment both in cash and in\\n[VAR 0xFF00(0006)]LP[VAR 0xFF00(0000)]—[VAR 0xFF00(0006)]League Points[VAR 0xFF00(0000)], that is. One LP is worth 1!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 45,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 51,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 56,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 73,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "common_0210_pokecen_07",
      "hash64": "AD11AC17AFBB89F8",
      "text": "And at the Union Circle, you can connect\\nwith other Trainers to find yourself some\\r\\nadventuring companions!",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 82,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "common_0210_pokecen_08",
      "hash64": "AD11AB17AFBB8845",
      "text": "Come visit us at the Pokémon Center anytime\\nyou need any help!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "common_0210_rival_05",
      "hash64": "38E36567BE56E3B1",
      "text": "We will. Thanks![VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "common_0210_rival_06",
      "hash64": "38E36267BE56DE98",
      "text": "Remember: “Had a rough adventure?\\nGet to the Pokémon Center!”\\c\\nSometimes you have to know this sort of stuff for\\nquizzes at school.[VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 61,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 133,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "common_0210_rival_08",
      "hash64": "38E36067BE56DB32",
      "text": "But mnemonics help out! Here’s another one:\\n“[VAR 0xFF00(0006)]‘R’ you ready?[VAR 0xFF00(0000)] Then [VAR 0xFF00(0006)]Let’s Go[VAR 0xFF00(0000)]!”\\c\\nGoofy, sure, but it helps you remember you can\\n[VAR 0xFF00(0006)]send your lead Pokémon out with the R Button[VAR 0xFF00(0000)]![VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 45,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 63,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 73,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 85,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 91,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 142,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 190,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 195,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "common_0210_rival_09",
      "hash64": "38E36167BE56DCE5",
      "text": "That way, you can have the Pokémon that’s\\nwalking with you go pick up items lying around\\r\\nor go battle on its own or other stuff like that![VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 88,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 141,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "common_0210_rival_07",
      "hash64": "38E36367BE56E04B",
      "text": "Now, time to go. Once we leave Los Platos, we’ll\\nhit the best-known spot in the South Province’s\\r\\nArea One: the massive hill on the way to school!\\c\\nYou’ll usually find Trainers there who are just\\nitching to battle. Good luck![VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 96,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
